# Admission slip QR-code destination — must come BEFORE the catch-all below.
# Netlify processes _redirects rules top-to-bottom (first match wins) and
# gives this file priority over netlify.toml's [[redirects]] block, which
# is why the equivalent rule there was silently never reached: the
# catch-all below matched /slip/<id> first. See netlify.toml's own comment
# for the full explanation of what this rewrites to and why.
/slip/*    /slip-app/index.html   200

# Flutter web is a single-page app; send unknown paths to index.html.
/*    /index.html   200
